{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想找一套今晚值得觀看的作品，往往比看劇本身更花時間。TVPilot 以自訂規則收窄選擇，適合獨自觀看或與伴侶一起決定片單的人，原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>自訂規則收窄今晚片單</h2>\n<p>TVPilot 以自訂規則收窄片單，只顯示已訂閱服務、未觀看或片長上限內的選擇，並以即時交疊的 Venn 圖呈現剩餘數量。可從 TMDB 目錄加入電影與劇集，附海報、簡介與評分。二人各自評分後，Compromise Pick 會找出雙方都想看的作品，選中後直接開啟對應平台，並以分享碼同步規則與評分。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-218-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-219-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-220-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-221-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-222-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-223-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：TVPilot: What to Watch</li>\n<li>應用類別：Entertainment</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T03:00:33.314246+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":306,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}